{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>QR generator + link storage 是一款專為內容創作者、社交媒體經營者、數碼營銷人員和網店店主而設的 QR 碼工具，可以為社交平台連結、網站或網店頁面及手機聯絡人（vCard）生成 QR 碼，並集中儲存與分類。App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>二維碼生成與整理</h2>\n<p>輸入社交平台連結、網頁或網店網址，即可快速生成 QR 碼，也可為手機聯絡人製作 vCard 數碼名片。所有 QR 碼會集中儲存在同一個 App，並可按類別整理，例如聯絡人清單，更可加入自訂標誌與頂部文字，然後儲存至相簿、列印、電郵或直接分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-131-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-132-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-133-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-285-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：QR generator + link storage</li>\n<li>應用類別：Social Networking</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T01:59:28.027814+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}